<i>Am I dreaming?</i>

477
00:23:11,042 --> 00:23:12,959
[NARRATOR] <i>But Claude</i>
<i>himself wasn't ready</i>

478
00:23:13,042 --> 00:23:14,792
<i>for what was in store for him.</i>

479
00:23:15,542 --> 00:23:17,876
<i>He had no idea that he would</i>
<i>come to be in charge</i>

480
00:23:17,959 --> 00:23:20,167
<i>of a class full of</i>
<i>problem students</i>

481
00:23:20,250 --> 00:23:23,417
<i>known to Diana Academy</i>
<i>as Pandora's Box.</i>

482
00:23:25,083 --> 00:23:26,501
I spent every day preparing for

483
00:23:26,584 --> 00:23:28,083
the Diana Academy
entrance exam.

484
00:23:28,167 --> 00:23:30,626
Not even rain or wind
can stop me from taking care of

485
00:23:30,709 --> 00:23:32,959
my family's oranges.
And all the effort paid off!

486
00:23:33,042 --> 00:23:34,918
The oranges turned out
delicious! Hooray!

487
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,125
Wait, what's fruit have to do
with the exam?

488
00:23:37,501 --> 00:23:39,751
Next episode:
"Magic of the Zodiac."

